# The packaged client zip is built from these files verbatim, so a CRLF
# checkout produces a different zip byte for byte and package/Client/RaceManager.zip
# shows as modified after every deploy. The diff is pure line endings and is
# worth nothing; eventually somebody commits one. Pinned to LF so a rebuild on
# any machine is reproducible.
*.lua  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Build artifacts and images: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.zip binary
*.png binary
